to be on with all of you.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.790
This is not the end by any sense,

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.690
we have lots of new episodes coming up.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.920
I did wanna take a moment
just to acknowledge

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.030
all the support and
engagement and encouragement

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.150
that all of you listeners have
given over this past year.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.290
Also for today's episode,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.050
we're doing something
a little bit different.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.470
The conversation is actually
going to be centered

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:46.260
